  "title": "Canada: TotalEnergies Signs an Agreement to Export 2 Mtpa of LNG for 20 years from the Ksi Lisims LNG Project",
  "summary": "TotalEnergies has signed an agreement with Ksi Lisims LNG to purchase 2 Mtpa of LNG for 20 years from the future plant located in Western Canada. TotalEnergies also takes a 5% stake in Western LNG, the developer, shareholder, and future operator of the Ksi Lisims LNG project. Paris, May 19, 2025 – TotalEnergies has signed […]",
